msgstr "Podporu získáš e-mailem na [info@j-ij.com](mailto:info@j-ij.com).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Další kroky {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Request a free trial of SQOA Solver by completing this [form](https://www.j-ij.com/en/qiskit-function-access).\n"
"  - Visit the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver) for this Qiskit Function.\n"
"  - Try an end-to-end example in the [maximum independent set problem](/tutorials/maximum-independent-set-jij-sqoa) tutorial.\n"
"  - Learn how to model optimization problems with [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-opt-mapper).\n"
"  - Learn how to model and exchange optimization problems with [JijModeling](https://jij-inc-jijmodeling-tutorials-en.readthedocs-hosted.com/en/latest/introduction.html) and [OMMX](https://ommx-en-book.readthedocs.io/en/latest/).\n"
"  - Read the SQOA-QR paper [\\[1\\]](#references) to learn more about the SQOA framework.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Doporučení\">\n"
"  - Požádej o bezplatnou zkušební verzi SQOA Solver vyplněním tohoto [formuláře](https://www.j-ij.com/en/qiskit-function-access).\n"
"  - Navštiv [referenční dokumentaci API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver) k této Qiskit Function.\n"
"  - Vyzkoušej kompletní příklad ve výukovém programu [problém maximální nezávislé množiny](/tutorials/maximum-independent-set-jij-sqoa).\n"
"  - Zjisti, jak modelovat optimalizační problémy pomocí [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-opt-mapper).\n"
"  - Zjisti, jak modelovat a vyměňovat optimalizační problémy pomocí [JijModeling](https://jij-inc-jijmodeling-tutorials-en.readthedocs-hosted.com/en/latest/introduction.html) a [OMMX](https://ommx-en-book.readthedocs.io/en/latest/).\n"
"  - Přečti si článek o SQOA-QR [\\[1\\]](#references), abys se o frameworku SQOA dozvěděl(a) více.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

